> 
> base::assign(".ptime", proc.time(), pos = "CheckExEnv")
> ### Name: price_arithmetic_asian_diffusion
> ### Title: Arithmetic Asian Option Price via Euler-Maruyama Monte Carlo
> ###   (Exogenous Diffusion)
> ### Aliases: price_arithmetic_asian_diffusion
> 
> ### ** Examples
> 
> # Basic call pricing
> price_arithmetic_asian_diffusion(
+   S0 = 100, K = 100, r = 0.05, sigma = 0.2, T = 1,
+   lambda_T = 0.01, I0 = 0, kappa = 1, eta = 0.1, rho = 0,
+   n_steps = 100, n_sims = 10000, seed = 42
+ )
Arithmetic Asian Option (Exogenous Diffusion, Euler-Maruyama MC)
================================================================
  Option type:       call
  Price:             5.725298
  Std error:         0.002980
  95% CI:           [5.719457, 5.731139]
  Geometric price:   5.546824 (closed-form benchmark)
  Correlation:       0.9997
  Control variate:   yes
  Simulations:       10000
  Time steps:        100
> 
> # With time-dependent eta
> eta_func <- function(t) 0.1 * (1 + 0.5 * t)
> price_arithmetic_asian_diffusion(
+   S0 = 100, K = 100, r = 0.05, sigma = 0.2, T = 1,
+   lambda_T = 0.01, I0 = 0.5, kappa = 2, eta = eta_func, rho = 0.3,
+   n_steps = 100, n_sims = 10000, seed = 42
+ )
Arithmetic Asian Option (Exogenous Diffusion, Euler-Maruyama MC)
================================================================
  Option type:       call
  Price:             5.812369
  Std error:         0.003006
  95% CI:           [5.806477, 5.818260]
  Geometric price:   5.631565 (closed-form benchmark)
  Correlation:       0.9997
  Control variate:   yes
  Simulations:       10000
  Time steps:        100
> 
